<div class="program-questions-page container py-3">
<h1>C# System.Char – 2 Questions per Function (Moderate–High)</h1>
<p>Use these questions for associate assessments and interview practice.</p>

<div class="section">
<h2>IsDigit</h2>
<ol>
<li class="question-item">Count numeric characters in a string containing spaces and digits.</li>
<li class="question-item">From "AB12C03Z9", extract digits and convert to an integer array.</li>
</ol>
</div>

